  "headline": "MPR Evaluates Election Procedures For New Vice President Nominees",
  "seoTitle": "MPR Discusses Vice President Election Date and Procedures",
  "metaDescription": "The MPR is finalizing selection mechanisms for the vice presidency after President Prabowo proposed two candidates to fill the vacant position.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo has officially submitted two candidates, Sugiono and Amran, to the MPR for the vice presidential position.",
    "The MPR Ad Hoc Committee is currently evaluating whether to select the vice president through consensus or a formal voting process.",
    "Expert consultations are being arranged to finalize the selection framework ahead of the upcoming legislative session."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The People's Consultative Assembly (MPR) is actively working to establish a formal mechanism for electing a new vice president. This follows the official submission of two candidates by President Prabowo, identified as Sugiono and Amran, to the assembly. The MPR's Ad Hoc Committee has begun organizing working groups to prepare for the subsequent inauguration process. Discussions are currently centered on determining the most appropriate procedure, weighing options between reaching a consensus through deliberation or proceeding with a legislative vote. To ensure consistency and procedural integrity, the assembly intends to consult with external experts regarding the selection framework. Meanwhile, political parties such as Golkar have indicated they are monitoring these developments before finalizing their stances. Once the election concludes and a new vice president is sworn in, the Presidential Security Force (Paspampres) will be deployed to provide protection for the official.",
